.TH TTY 1.SH NAMEtty \- name the terminal.SH SYNOPSIS\fBtty\fR.SH DESCRIPTION\fBtty\fRprints the name of the device its standard input is attached to, withoutthe leading slash:\fBterm\fRat the console,\fBt1\fRon a serial port,\fBnil\fRwhen the input comes from\fB/nil\fR.\fR.SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fR